    fields:  # b87f
      statement: "edge.meta.evidence_type has 31 distinct values. Four of them all describe imports with different names: ast_import (10462), import_static (15), import_declaration (1), import_statement (1). Several 1-occurrence values smell vestigial: callback_argument_reference (1), use_declaration (1), trait_impl (1), import_declaration (1), import_statement (1)"  # b87f
      root_cause: "evidence_type is the registered heavyweight axis (ADR-0027/0028). The fact that imports have 4 names (ast_import vs import_static vs import_declaration vs import_statement) suggests linker-by-linker drift in vocabulary — each linker invented its own term for the same concept. The 1-occurrence types may be live (single test fixture) or dead code paths. Worth bundling under the classification_axes audit alongside extends/inherits/implements (VV)"  # b87f
